run, watch, detached supervisor) (#7)\\nstate:\\tDRAFT\\nauthor:\\tuser (Amogh Akshintala)\\nlabels:\\t\\nassignees:\\t\\nreviewers:\\t\\nprojects:\\t\\nmilestone:\\t\\nnumber:\\t20\\nurl:\\thttps://github.com/user/delegate/pull/20\\nadditions:\\t592\\ndeletions:\\t0\\nauto-merge:\\tdisabled\\n--\\nFixes #7\\n\\n- New `delegate` binary (`src/bin/delegate.rs`, `src/cli.rs`) beside the MCP server, which is unchanged.\\n- `delegate run` validates input, writes `$TMPDIR/delegate-jobs/<uuid>.json`, starts a detached supervisor (own session and process group), prints the job id and exits. The supervisor runs cursor-agent, writes a heartbeat (`lastHeartbeatAt`, 30s default, `DELEGATE_HEARTBEAT_MS` override), and writes the terminal record with `supervisorPid` and `resume {model, cwd, capability, sessionId}`.\\n- `delegate watch <id>... [--timeout S]` prints o [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-7.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":61,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_dd79c2e2-ff7b-4ab2-9a16-24b3e24e613\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-7-tracer && gh issue view 4 --json body,title\",\"workingDirectory\":\"\",\"timeout\":30000,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_dd79c2e2-ff7b-4ab2-9a16-24b3e24e613\",\"simpleCommands\":[\"cd\",\"gh\"],\"hasInputRedirect\":false,\"hasOutputRedirect\":false,\"parsingResult\":{\"parsingFailed\":false,\"executableCommands\":[{\"name\":\"cd\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-7-tracer\"}],\"fullText\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-7-tracer\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"view\"},{\"type\":\"number\",\"value\":\"4\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"--json\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"body,title\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh issue view 4 --json body,title\"}],\"hasRedirects\":false,\"hasCommandSubstitution\":false,\"redirects\":[]},\"fileOutputThresholdBytes\":\"40000\",\"isBackground\":false,\"skipApproval\":false,\"timeoutBehavior\":\"TIMEOUT_BEHA [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/ponytail-18.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":42,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_382f9437-f427-4428-93a5-4f208b55658\",\"tool_call\":{\"readToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"path\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-6-record-fixtures/scripts/record.sh\"},\"result\":{\"success\":{\"content\":\"#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# Run one prompt through a backend's raw headless CLI and save stdout/stderr as a parser fixture.\\n#\\n#   scripts/record.sh BACKEND MODEL CAPABILITY NAME [CWD] [SESSION] < prompt\\n#\\n# BACKEND: cursor | pi | claude. CAPABILITY: read-only | read-write (pi rejects read-only).\\n# SESSION resumes that backend session; pi and claude get a fresh id when it is omitted.\\n# CANCEL_AFTER=N sends the CLI SIGTERM after N seconds.\\n# Writes tests/fixtures/BACKEND/NAME.{stdout,stderr,argv}; prints the session id (if chosen) and exit code.\\nset -uo pipefail\\n\\n[ $# -ge 4 ] || { sed -n 2,9p \\\"$0\\\"; exit 2; }\\nbackend=$1 model=$2 cap=$3 name=$4 cwd=${5:-$PWD} session=${6:-}\\nhere=\\\"$(cd \\\"$(dirname \\\"$0\\\")\\\" && pwd)\\\"\\nout=\\\"$here/../tests/fixtures/$ [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":94,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_85f38594-7167-4fe5-810d-1c84ff0ef14\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"gh api \\\"repos/user/delegate/contents/scripts/record.sh?ref=refs/pull/18/head\\\" --jq .content | base64 -d | cat -n\",\"workingDirectory\":\"\",\"timeout\":30000,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_85f38594-7167-4fe5-810d-1c84ff0ef14\",\"simpleCommands\":[\"gh\",\"base64\",\"cat\"],\"hasInputRedirect\":false,\"hasOutputRedirect\":false,\"parsingResult\":{\"parsingFailed\":false,\"executableCommands\":[{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"api\"},{\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\\\"repos/user/delegate/contents/scripts/record.sh?ref=refs/pull/18/head\\\"\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"--jq\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\".content\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh api \\\"repos/user/delegate/contents/scripts/record.sh?ref=refs/pull/18/head\\\" --jq .content\"},{\"name\":\"base64\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"-d\"}],\"fullText\":\"base64 -d\"},{\"name\":\"cat\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"-n\"}],\"fullText\":\"cat -n\"}],\"hasRedirects\": [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":105,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_7c7c53bc-c228-417b-9c3a-249362c25ab\",\"tool_call\":{\"readToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"path\":\"/Users/user/.cursor/projects/Users-user-work-delegate-6-record-fixtures/agent-tools/119c6ec8-e9e6-42c3-adef-5753f728adc1.txt\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":90},\"result\":{\"success\":{\"content\":\"diff --git a/scripts/record.sh b/scripts/record.sh\\nnew file mode 100755\\nindex 0000000..d5488c9\\n--- /dev/null\\n+++ b/scripts/record.sh\\n@@ -0,0 +1,54 @@\\n+#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n+# Run one prompt through a backend's raw headless CLI and save stdout/stderr as a parser fixture.\\n+#\\n+#   scripts/record.sh BACKEND MODEL CAPABILITY NAME [CWD] [SESSION] < prompt\\n+#\\n+# BACKEND: cursor | pi | claude. CAPABILITY: read-only | read-write (pi rejects read-only).\\n+# SESSION resumes that backend session; pi and claude get a fresh id when it is omitted.\\n+# CANCEL_AFTER=N sends the CLI SIGTERM after N seconds.\\n+# Writes tests/fixtures/BACKEND/NAME.{stdout,stderr,argv}; prints the  [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/lane-8-ci.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":22,"content":"{\"type\":\